{"title": "The Courts of Chaos", "pageid": 2059, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In the <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Amber\" title=\"The Chronicles of Amber\">Chronicles of Amber</a></i>, the multiverse has two \"poles\": <a href=\"/wiki/Amber\" title=\"Amber\">Amber</a> and the <b>Courts of Chaos</b>. Whereas Amber is the pole of Order, the Courts of Chaos are the pole of Chaos/Destruction. The main character of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Amber#The_Merlin_Cycle\" title=\"The Chronicles of Amber\">Merlin Cycle</a></i>, namely <a href=\"/wiki/Merlin\" title=\"Merlin\">Merlin</a>, was born and raised in the Courts of Chaos.\n</p><p>The Courts of Chaos float above the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Abyss\" title=\"The Abyss\">Abyss</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Suhuy\" title=\"Suhuy\">Suhuy</a> taught Merlin how to summon the destructive energies of the Abyss, which Merlin later used to defeat the occultist <span class=\"new\" title=\"Victor Melman (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmljdG9yX01lbG1hbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Victor Melman</span>.\n</p><p><b>The Courts of Chaos</b> is the fifth book in the series <i>Chronicles of Amber</i> by Roger Zelazny. This book ends the original series narrated by <a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin</a>. The next series begins with <i>Trumps of Doom</i> following his son, <a href=\"/wiki/Merlin\" title=\"Merlin\">Merlin</a>, as the protagonist.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/The_Courts_of_Chaos?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260427214006\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 360/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.273      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.273      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2059-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260427214006 and revision id 4502. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Amber", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Corwin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Merlin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Suhuy", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Abyss", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Chronicles of Amber", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Victor Melman", "exists": false}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/The_Courts_of_Chaos"}